    DisplayName: The Golden Fleece
    Description: Wards YOU cast stop timing out -- yours, wherever you put them,
      including the ones the Flock spreads. They last the fight, until something
      spends them. A ward somebody else put on you keeps its own clock. Free, gated
      at 20 embers spent in this path.
